  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "<p>Melbourne City Institute of Education is a leading provider of outcomes-focused quality vocational education and training programs. Based in Melbourne, <a href=\"https://edvoy.com/countries/study-in-australia/\">Australia</a>, they offer skill-relevant local and international courses and have lucrative industry partnerships to provide a pathway to a bright future to all students.</p><p>The learning experience at the institute is dynamic and often practical in focus so students are prepared to enter the workforce and achieve their career goals.</p> <p>The student common areas are designed to promote both relaxation and study, while the free WIFI enables students with convenient access to information for both educational and personal use. State of the art hospitality is provided by the MCIE commercial kitchen on-campus.</p><p>Due to their practical-based learning focus, there are even Childhood Education &amp; Care and Aged Care simulation training rooms for students studying relevant qualifications.</p> <p><strong>Student Life</strong></p> <p>The student welfare team can be contacted at any time to support student wellbeing. The MCIE Computer Lab is located at the main campus so students can easily study whenever they need to and move around easily. Students have the chance to participate in the orientation programme to show new students around the campus and get involved in volunteering.</p><p>Many students join student clubs and play sports as Melbourne is ranked very highly in terms of sports and leisure opportunities.</p>"
    ]
  },
